<title>FINLAND: TULIKIVI PROPOSES HIGHER 1996 DIVIDENDS.</title>
<headline>TULIKIVI PROPOSES HIGHER 1996 DIVIDENDS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Proposed dividend, old A shr		  3.00 vs 1.00</p>
<p> Proposed dividend, new A shr		  1.50 vs n/a</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax    14.7 vs 1.6</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	34.0 vs 20.1</p>
<p> Depreciation					16.8 vs 14.0</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 2.4 vs 4.5 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		     charge 2.4 vs nil</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	 12.3 vs 1.6</p>
<p> Taxes						  3.4 vs 0.4</p>
<p> Net profit					   8.9 vs 1.5</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    56.1 vs 47.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish stone fireplace maker is Tulikivi</p>
<p>Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
